<title>USA: Blount gives CFO expanded duties.</title>
<headline>Blount gives CFO expanded duties.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blount International Inc said Wednesday it has promoted Chief Financial Officer Harold Layman, expanding his duties to include the title of executive vice president of finance operations.</p>
<p>Layman, who has been senior vice president and chief financial officer since January 1993, has had his duties expanded to include other aspects of the operations as well as the general audit functions of the company.</p>
</text>
